Subject: Truncation via user defined imperfect distribution
Message-ID: <WBHgZakr-Y4.fmM6GatJAwAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/nimble-users/c/WBHgZakr-Y4/m/fmM6GatJAwAJ>
